<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov antimony exports rise 35.3 percent.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov antimony exports rise 35.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought antimony rose to 27,847 tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996, up 35.3 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Antimony exports were 3,090 tonnes in November alone.</p>
<p>Exports of antimony were 20,576 tonnes in the first 11 months of 1995.</p>
</text>
